    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"quiet and still\"... that's the only thing that sounds even remotely peaceful anymore. everything else is just so loud and exhausting. it's like i'm a ghost trying to live in a world that's still moving, but i've already left. i just wonder if there's any point in trying to find \"pieces\" again when the whole shape of me is just gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
